    <pubDate>Wed, 01 Oct 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <description>After retiring from NYU&apos;s Journalism department, the author is taking on a part-time Senior Fellow position at the Lenfest Institute for Journalism. This role will involve advising, writing, and public appearances, drawing on the author&apos;s expertise regarding the evolving role of the press and the challenges facing local news. The Lenfest Institute is a funder of local news organizations and the author has a history with the institute, having previously served on its board.
</description>
